msgid "Tailscale is a mesh VPN solution that makes it easy to connect your devices securely. This configuration page allows you to manage Tailscale settings on your OpenWrt device."
msgstr "Tailscale 是一種網狀 Mesh VPN 解決方案，可讓您安全輕鬆地連接各類裝置。此頁面用於管理 OpenWrt 上的 Tailscale 服務設定。"

msgid "Tailscale is not installed."
msgstr "Tailscale 未安裝。"

msgid "Tailscale is not logged in. Please log in to view devices."
msgstr "Tailscale 未登入。請先登入以檢視裝置列表。"

msgid "Tailscale is not running."
msgstr "Tailscale 未執行。"

msgid "This can take up to 30 seconds."
msgstr "此過程最長可能需要 30 秒。"

msgid "This will disconnect this device from your Tailnet and require you to re-authenticate."
msgstr "這將中斷本裝置與 Tailnet 的連線，並且需要重新進行身分驗證。"

msgid "UDP port for the Peer Relay service (--peer-relay-port). Open this port on your router firewall/NAT."
msgstr "節點中繼服務的 UDP 連接埠 (--peer-relay-port)。請確保在路由器防火牆中放行此連接埠。"

msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "未知錯誤"

msgid "Use OpenWrt system firewall to manage NAT for Tailscale tunnel and subnet traffic. Disabling this option disables source address masquerading to preserve real source IPs of remote peers and subnets in the local network."
msgstr "由 OpenWrt 系統防火牆統一接管 Tailscale 隧道及對端子網流量的位址轉換。停用此項將停用來源位址偽裝，在區域網路中保留對端節點和子網的真實來源 IP。"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本資訊"

msgid "When enabled, blocks all inbound connections from the Tailscale network (--shields-up)."
msgstr "啟用後，阻止所有來自 Tailscale 網路的主動入站連線 (--shields-up)。"

msgid "When using or advertising the exit node, allow access to the local LAN (--exit-node-allow-lan-access)."
msgstr "在使用或宣告出口節點時，允許存取本地區域網路裝置 (--exit-node-allow-lan-access)。"

